@startuml
actor Owner
actor Recipient
participant Client
participant "API Service" as API
participant "Auth / ACL" as ACL
database "Metadata / ACL state" as DB
queue "Event Bus" as Bus
participant "Notification Service" as Notify
participant CDN

Owner -> Client : Share file
Client -> API : Update permissions
API -> ACL : Validate owner rights
ACL -> DB : Save ACL change
DB --> ACL : OK
ACL -> Bus : file.shared
Bus -> Notify : Notify recipient
Notify -> Recipient : File shared

Recipient -> API : Download file
API -> ACL : Check access
ACL --> API : Allowed
API --> Recipient : Signed URL
Recipient -> CDN : Download

Owner -> Client : Revoke access
Client -> API : Revoke permission
API -> ACL : Remove access
ACL -> DB : Persist revoke
ACL -> Bus : file.changed

Recipient -> API : Download again
API -> ACL : Check access
ACL --> API : Denied
API --> Recipient : 403 / access denied
@enduml